Expense Tracker JS is a beginner-friendly JavaScript project that demonstrates how to store, evaluate, and calculate personal expenses using JavaScript.
The project is part of the Personal Budget & Expense Tracker learning project and focuses on fundamental JavaScript concepts such as variables, conditional statements, arrays, loops, and comparison operators.
