Each expense is stored as a numeric value.
Part 2: Flag High Spending
Conditional statements using if, else if, and else were used to check each expense individually.
Any expense greater than $100 is displayed in the browser console as High Spending. Expenses of $100 or less are displayed as Normal Spending.
Part 3: Calculate Total Expenses
All six expense values were stored in an array.
A for...of loop was used to calculate the total expenses. The expenses were not manually added together.
